# Day 02 — SQL Sorting, Limiting & Pattern Matching

## Objective

Learn how to sort, limit, remove duplicate values, and search text patterns using SQL.

## Topics Learned

- ORDER BY
- ASC
- DESC
- WHERE + ORDER BY
- LIMIT
- DISTINCT
- LIKE
- AND
- Combining multiple SQL clauses

## 1. ORDER BY

Used to sort data.

### Ascending

```sql
ORDER BY cgpa ASC;
